exports[`ProposalArtifact semantic-only confirmation enforcement > snapshot: destructive financial deletion avoids generic CRUD language 1`] = `"<div class="space-y-3"><div class="space-y-2" data-testid="decision-confirmation-turn"><div class="agent-message-row"><div class="agent-chat-text text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 px-1"><div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none break-words text-sm leading-relaxed"><p>I can delete financial entry. Please confirm before I apply that change.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border shadow-sm overflow-hidden border-rose-300 bg-rose-50/80 dark:border-rose-800/70 dark:bg-rose-950/20" data-testid="decision-confirmation-panel" data-tone="destructive" data-state="awaiting_decision"><div class="h-1 bg-rose-500"></div><div class="px-4 py-3.5 space-y-3"><div class="space-y-1"><div class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Destructive Tone</div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Confirm: Delete Financial Entry</h3><p class="text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">This will delete financial entry.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border p-3 space-y-3 bg-rose-50/70 dark:bg-rose-950/20 border-rose-200/70 dark:border-rose-800/60"><div class="space-y-2.5"><div class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">What changes</div><div class="space-y-1.5"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border border-slate-200/70 bg-white/80 px-2.5 py-2 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:border-slate-700/60 dark:bg-slate-900/25 dark:text-slate-200"><span class="mt-1 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-slate-400 dark:bg-slate-500"></span><span><span class="font-medium">Planned change: </span>Delete financial entry.</span></div></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><div class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">What this affects</div><div class="space-y-1.5"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-2 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 border-rose-200/70 bg-rose-50/90 dark:border-rose-800/60 dark:bg-rose-950/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span>Related totals will be recalculated.</span></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-2 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 border-rose-200/70 bg-rose-50/90 dark:border-rose-800/60 dark:bg-rose-950/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span>This is a permanent change and cannot be undone.</span></div></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><div class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Can this be undone?</div><div class="space-y-1.5"><div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-2.5 py-2 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 border-slate-200/70 bg-white/80 dark:border-slate-700/60 dark:bg-slate-900/25"><span class="mt-1 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-slate-400 dark:bg-slate-500"></span><span>Not reversible.</span></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1"><button type="button" class="agent-action-btn 